.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH mnnn-ingest-service-http 1  "mnnn-ingest-service-http 2.7.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-ingest\-service\-http \- Flags shared by every service
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn ingest service http\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] <\fB\-\-url\fR> [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-X\fR|\fB\-\-method\fR] [\fB\-\-body\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-param\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-H\fR|\fB\-\-header\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-records\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-paginate\fR] [\fB\-\-cursor\-path\fR] [\fB\-\-cursor\-param\fR] [\fB\-\-start\-param\fR] [\fB\-\-from\fR] [\fB\-\-to\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-pages\fR] [\fB\-\-rate\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-retries\fR] [\fB\-\-insecure\fR] [\fB\-\-source\fR] [\fB\-\-symbol\fR] [\fB\-\-duration\fR] [\fB\-\-map\fR] [\fB\-\-rejects\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-recursive\fR] [\fB\-\-timeout\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Flags shared by every service
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-X\fR, \fB\-\-method\fR \fI<METHOD>\fR [default: get]

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
get
.IP \(bu 2
post
.IP \(bu 2
put
.IP \(bu 2
patch
.IP \(bu 2
delete
.IP \(bu 2
head
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-body\fR \fI<BODY>\fR
Request body, or @FILE. Only with POST/PUT/PATCH
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-param\fR \fI<KEY=VALUE>\fR
Query parameter KEY=VALUE (repeatable, URL\-encoded)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-H\fR, \fB\-\-header\fR \fI<KEY: VALUE>\fR
Header "KEY: VALUE" (repeatable, overrides defaults)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
Response format (default: from Content\-Type)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
csv
.IP \(bu 2
ndjson
.RE
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-records\fR \fI<RECORDS>\fR
Where the array of bars lives in the JSON response
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-paginate\fR \fI<PAGINATE>\fR [default: none]

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
none
.IP \(bu 2
cursor
.IP \(bu 2
time
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-cursor\-path\fR \fI<CURSOR_PATH>\fR [default: next]
cursor pagination: path of the next cursor in the response
.TP
\fB\-\-cursor\-param\fR \fI<CURSOR_PARAM>\fR [default: cursor]
cursor pagination: query parameter that carries the cursor
.TP
\fB\-\-start\-param\fR \fI<START_PARAM>\fR [default: startTime]
time pagination: query parameter for the window start (epoch ms)
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<FROM>\fR
time pagination: start time
.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI<TO>\fR
time pagination: end time
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-pages\fR \fI<MAX_PAGES>\fR [default: 1000]

.TP
\fB\-\-rate\-limit\fR \fI<RATE_LIMIT>\fR
Requests per second
.TP
\fB\-\-retries\fR \fI<RETRIES>\fR [default: 3]

.TP
\fB\-\-insecure\fR
Skip TLS verification (insecure)
.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<SOURCE>\fR
Where the data came from, e.g. coinbase (created if unknown). Default: an exchange named in the file name (binance_…, coinbase_…), else a prompt
.TP
\fB\-\-symbol\fR \fI<SYMBOL>\fR
Symbol, e.g. BTC/USDT, BTC\-USD or BTCUSDT
.TP
\fB\-\-duration\fR \fI<DURATION>\fR
Bar duration, e.g. 5m, 1h, 1d
.TP
\fB\-\-map\fR \fI<COL=FIELD>\fR
Column mapping `<col>=<field>` (fields: timestamp, open, high, low, close, volume). Repeatable
.TP
\fB\-\-rejects\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Write rejected rows (with reasons) to this CSV
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Re\-process even if this exact input was already ingested
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-recursive\fR
For a directory \-\-path: only its top level (default: search subdirectories too)
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fR \fI<TIMEOUT>\fR [default: 30]
Timeout in seconds
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.7.0
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
